Lab 20: Final Exam Preparation and Full Stack Deployment
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Design and implement a complete OpenShift application workflow from development to production deployment
Containerize a three-tier application (frontend, backend, database) using Podman and OpenShift best practices
Configure persistent storage, database initialization, and service networking between application tiers
Implement horizontal pod autoscaling, resource quotas, and limit ranges for production workloads
Perform load testing and troubleshoot common OpenShift deployment issues
